# Card Shader Reflections — a snapping horizontal carousel of four tilted payment cards (Metal, Silver, Gold, Platinum) each rendered by a heavy Skia runtime shader (brushed metal normals, environment reflection) whose rotate uniform follows the scroll; cards flip on Y and fade as they leave the centre.
# What this test covers: paging one card at a time with slow drags through every card (centred title asserted),
# overscrolling past both ends, a half drag that snaps back, fast flings across several cards (four shaders
# animating at once), interrupting a fling with a new drag, and paging back to the first card.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/card-shader-reflections"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait "text" "METAL" 10000
wait 800
# One card at a time.
gesture pan 340 437 -295 0 900
wait 1000
wait "text" "SILVER" 6000
gesture pan 340 437 -295 0 900
wait 1000
wait "text" "GOLD" 6000
gesture pan 340 437 -295 0 900
wait 1000
wait "text" "PLATINUM" 6000
# Overscroll past the last card.
gesture pan 330 437 -200 0 600
wait 1000
wait "text" "PLATINUM" 6000
# Half drag back: snaps back to Platinum.
gesture pan 120 300 90 0 900
wait 1000
# Fast flings across the carousel and back, interrupting one.
swipe 90 437 360 437
wait 200
gesture pan 140 300 120 0 400
wait 1200
swipe 360 437 60 437
wait 1200
swipe 60 437 360 437
wait 400
swipe 60 437 360 437
wait 1500
# Back to the start and overscroll it.
gesture pan 110 300 260 0 600
wait 300
gesture pan 110 300 260 0 600
wait 300
gesture pan 110 300 260 0 600
wait 300
gesture pan 110 300 260 0 600
wait 1200
wait "text" "METAL" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
